+/-- The owner descriptor already carries and validates the complete file
+identity. Its presentation header has no independent input: the former
+publication was exactly `fileStored file`. No IO/cache owner is needed. -/
+def fileReady (file : File) : FileReady := ⟨fileStored file,rfl,rfl⟩
